    "key_insight_1": "Employees who resigned reported a lower mean Work-Life Balance Rating (7.84) compared to retained employees (8.07), a difference of -0.23. This difference is statistically significant (p=0.017), indicating a potential link between poorer work-life balance and attrition.",
